{"id":"631790","name":"花生蜜枣粽子","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631790/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯净水","amount":"若干"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取糯米。","img":"images/631790/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/631790/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放纯净水浸泡。","img":"images/631790/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"买的新鲜粽叶，洗一下。","img":"images/631790/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放锅里煮。","img":"images/631790/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"开锅几分钟即可。","img":"images/631790/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"冷水浸泡。","img":"images/631790/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"花生米洗净，浸泡。","img":"images/631790/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蜜枣备好。","img":"images/631790/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"泡好的花生米。","img":"images/631790/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"泡好的糯米。","img":"images/631790/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"粽叶一片压一片摆在碗里。","img":"images/631790/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"全部摆好。","img":"images/631790/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放糯米。","img":"images/631790/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放蜜枣。","img":"images/631790/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再放糯米。","img":"images/631790/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放花生。","img":"images/631790/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"再放糯米。","img":"images/631790/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"包起来。","img":"images/631790/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"入高压锅。","img":"images/631790/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"用一个盘子或者碗的压着，粽子碗里碗里倒上开水。","img":"images/631790/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"开煮。","img":"images/631790/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"煮好的粽子。","img":"images/631790/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"取出来，把叶子打开。","img":"images/631790/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631790/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"粽子碗里的开水放少了，粽子顶部的米看起来有点干，应该跟粽子齐平就好了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}